# Hart-Portfolio-v2 agent context

Before choosing commands or adding tooling, read:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/agent-context.md`
- `README.md`

The stack is React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + TailwindCSS, with Three.js / @react-three/fiber / @react-three/drei and GSAP + ScrollTrigger for the 3D, scroll-driven experience. Package manager is npm. Standard commands: `npm install`, `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`.

Story comes first: every change must reinforce the Curiosity → Systems → Impact narrative. Narrative copy lives in `src/data/journey.ts`.

When implementation adds or changes setup, architecture, verification, or deployment details, update the agent context docs in the same change.
